$ Simcenter Nastran 2606.5000 (Linux, 2026-10-01): the print of
$ utilities/open_source_software/NASTRAN/test/decks/aeroelastic_guide_examples/ha144a.dat
$ (the Aeroelastic guide's HA144A, a symmetric half model with DMI W2GJ / WKK / FA2J, two
$ Mach 0.9 trims at q = 40 and 1200), cut to the stability and control derivative tables
$ and the aeroelastic trim variables of both subcases. Simcenter prints the guide's listing
$ 7-2 to every digit (ANGLEA 1.691910E-01, ELEV 4.924567E-01 in subcase 1).
$ test_nastran95ase_trim_corrections.m holds nastran95ase to it.
